  "id": "count-at-least-max-hoist",
  "algorithm": {
    "source": "pub fn count_at_least_max(values: &[i64], queries: &[i64]) -> usize {\n    let mut count = 0;\n    for q in queries {\n        let mut best = i64::MIN;\n        for v in values {\n            if *v > best {\n                best = *v;\n            }\n        }\n        if *q >= best {\n            count += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    count\n}\n",
    "language": "rust",
    "entryPoint": "count_at_least_max(values: &[i64], queries: &[i64]) -> usize",
    "inputAlphabet": "Two slices of i64. n is values.len() and q is queries.len(); the result counts the queries at least as large as every value."
  },
